<title>GERMANY: Schwarz Pharma - H1 gp sales 632.8 mln dm.</title>
<headline>Schwarz Pharma - H1 gp sales 632.8 mln dm.</headline>
<dateline>MONHEIM, Germany 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1997 to June 30.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  632.8   vs 588.3</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit		   68.5    up 31 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German drugs group is Schwarz Pharma AG. The company also said it expected DVFA earnings per share of 5.10 marks for 1997 and that sales would grow five percent for the year as a whole.</p>
<p>--Bonn Newsroom + 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
